uest und in einer \u00fcberarbeiteten visuellen Umgebung!\n\n**Features**\n\n- Viele verschiedene Lebensmittel: Vom Brokkoli \u00fcber Fleisch bin hin zu K\u00e4se!\n- Schalte Ausr\u00fcstung f\u00fcr bessere Effizienz frei: Lagere Produkte in deinem K\u00fchlschrank, um sie frisch zu halten; werde von einer T\u00fcrklingel \u00fcber neue Kunden informiert und lagere deine Geldb\u00fcndel im Geldtresor!\n- 3 Schwierigkeitsstufen\n- Puppenhaus-Modus f\u00fcr kleinere Spieler", "short_description": "Sei dein eigener Boss im Supermarkt! Bediene Kunden, kaufe Waren und maximiere deinen Profit, um die Miete f\u00fcr den n\u00e4chsten Tag zahlen zu k\u00f6nnen!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.shopkeeper-simulator.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Glock Software", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.shopkeeper-simulator.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "de"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26982957284683737"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 15, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2314345005985470"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1307990245728319"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "934081066258050"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "756620410646028"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2466338080524235"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "16035055477308